&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:15.6pt;min-height:15.6pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;当事業年度における取得自己株式&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:15.6pt;min-height:15.6pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;"&gt;残存決議株式の総数及び価額の総額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;－&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
